            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yeah, I've thought about it, and it doesn't seem to be a proper solution to this. It is just that 'mini.clue' is not suited for this kind of \"submodes\".\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned (but good to have, just there seems to be no way of doing it properly).",
